            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li><b>Frame-rate on export</b> — deliver at a lower frame rate (e.g. 50p footage as 25p) via clean frame-dropping, matching Premiere.</li>
  <li>LUT-stack colour grading with Premiere-matched corrections (contrast, saturation, whites/blacks).</li>
  <li>Reframe to multiple aspect ratios, per-clip trim &amp; mute.</li>
  <li>Batch export with delivery presets (Instagram 1080p H.264 / Master 4K HEVC) and a shareable caption.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
